{
 "engine": "apple-speech",
 "model": "os",
 "lang": "en",
 "wav": "en_full.wav",
 "segments": [
  {
   "start_ms": 37260,
   "end_ms": 40500,
   "text": "It was the fall of 2017."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 47820,
   "text": " My uncle was hit by a truck when he was only 17.",
   "end_ms": 51780
  },
  {
   "text": " And since then, I've been in a coma for 17 years.",
   "start_ms": 52800,
   "end_ms": 56400
  },
  {
   "text": " Until he woke up.",
   "end_ms": 60180,
   "start_ms": 57660
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 70560,
   "end_ms": 75840,
   "text": " Birellers, Gran Baja Maltona, Galtoba Relax."
  },
  {
   "text": " And he lost his mind.",
   "end_ms": 79500,
   "start_ms": 77280
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 83940,
   "text": " Yeah...",
   "start_ms": 82620
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 85200,
   "text": " I don't understand.",
   "start_ms": 84480
  },
  {
   "text": " Japanese?",
   "end_ms": 87600,
   "start_ms": 85920
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 89340,
   "end_ms": 91560,
   "text": " Oh, my bad."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 91620,
   "text": " I was in Grand Bahama, a fantasy world.",
   "end_ms": 94440
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 94560,
   "end_ms": 96420,
   "text": " Well, they speak a whole different language."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 96540,
   "end_ms": 97380,
   "text": " Ha!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 100380,
   "end_ms": 102060,
   "text": " Good morning."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 102480,
   "text": " Zombe, Madeira, costonum costonum.",
   "end_ms": 106260
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 106380,
   "end_ms": 108180,
   "text": " Let's take your temperature."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 116820,
   "start_ms": 111300,
   "text": " El storba, tona rebelgao. All right, I'll check on you later."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 128520,
   "text": " You're Takafumi, my sister's kid.",
   "start_ms": 125880
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 132720,
   "text": " But where is, uh... everyone else?",
   "start_ms": 128639
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 135840,
   "end_ms": 138660,
   "text": " Well, our family had a huge falling out because of you."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 143160,
   "text": " What to do with you while you were in a coma, and let me tell you, it wasn't cheap.",
   "start_ms": 138780
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 146520,
   "start_ms": 143880,
   "text": " My mom said..."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 147420,
   "start_ms": 146640,
   "text": " She didn't wanna see you."
  },
  {
   "text": " Yakura's Kura.",
   "start_ms": 151800,
   "end_ms": 154560
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 157740,
   "end_ms": 158160,
   "text": " Okay."
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "end_ms": 158940,
   "start_ms": 158340
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 161700,
   "start_ms": 159060,
   "text": " I'll prove Gran Bahamal is real."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 165120,
   "text": " Uh, you really don't...",
   "start_ms": 161760
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 167040,
   "text": " War Grant Zeld.",
   "start_ms": 165480
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 170760,
   "start_ms": 170220,
   "text": " Okay."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 173820,
   "text": " Margret Magna.",
   "start_ms": 171600
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 176940,
   "text": " Wagren, Rand?",
   "end_ms": 178500
  },
  {
   "text": " This is... What? Just sad.",
   "start_ms": 178620,
   "end_ms": 180720
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 182340,
   "text": " What we got?",
   "start_ms": 180840
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 182460,
   "end_ms": 183840,
   "text": " What, Red Pat?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Hey, Uncle.",
   "start_ms": 183960,
   "end_ms": 184740
  },
  {
   "text": " Lunch.",
   "start_ms": 185100,
   "end_ms": 185700
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 187500,
   "start_ms": 185760,
   "text": " Money has been a little tight lately."
  },
  {
   "text": ".",
   "start_ms": 187800,
   "end_ms": 189060
  },
  {
   "text": " So I brought some documents for you to sign.",
   "end_ms": 190680,
   "start_ms": 189120
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 190800,
   "end_ms": 194820,
   "text": " And after that, they're going to send you somewhere to help you get back."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 195360,
   "text": " Wait on your feet.",
   "start_ms": 194880
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 195420,
   "end_ms": 196080,
   "text": " Carrie!"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 206700,
   "text": " What the hell?",
   "start_ms": 205200
  },
  {
   "text": " Wind, return it.",
   "end_ms": 208440,
   "start_ms": 206880
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 210120,
   "end_ms": 211680,
   "text": " Of course."
  },
  {
   "text": " it's Japanese here.",
   "start_ms": 211800,
   "end_ms": 212760
  },
  {
   "text": " That's all real.",
   "start_ms": 227880,
   "end_ms": 228900
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 230400,
   "end_ms": 232260,
   "text": " Hold on, now."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 232380,
   "end_ms": 235080,
   "text": " Did you just say you were sending me away somewhere?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Nope, I didn't.",
   "end_ms": 236640,
   "start_ms": 235140
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 236760,
   "text": " You sure?",
   "end_ms": 238380
  },
  {
   "text": " Yeah, yeah.",
   "start_ms": 238440,
   "end_ms": 238920
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 239520,
   "text": " So, what was that?",
   "start_ms": 238980
  },
  {
   "text": " Hmm...",
   "end_ms": 240540,
   "start_ms": 239580
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 241740,
   "text": " It's magic.",
   "start_ms": 240600
  },
  {
   "text": " Fire.",
   "start_ms": 241860,
   "end_ms": 243300
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 243780,
   "end_ms": 246000,
   "text": " Whoa, awesome!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 246060,
   "text": " Wait, how are you doing that?",
   "end_ms": 247320
  },
  {
   "text": " That's nothing.",
   "end_ms": 248580,
   "start_ms": 247380
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 251220,
   "text": " I want to know if Sega won the console wars.",
   "start_ms": 248700
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 251280,
   "end_ms": 251940,
   "text": " Huh?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Say, I?",
   "end_ms": 253320,
   "start_ms": 252000
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 253620,
   "text": " Now?",
   "end_ms": 255000
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 259920,
   "text": " Well, these days, Sony and Nintendo are the biggest console makers.",
   "start_ms": 255180
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "start_ms": 259980,
   "end_ms": 260880
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 261899,
   "text": " No Sega?",
   "start_ms": 261000
  },
  {
   "text": " Is this important?",
   "start_ms": 262019,
   "end_ms": 263820
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 264060,
   "end_ms": 264900,
   "text": " Sega."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 265020,
   "end_ms": 266520,
   "text": " Well..."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 267120,
   "text": " They, uh, stopped making console.",
   "end_ms": 268560
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 271920,
   "text": " The Kurus Kurora.",
   "end_ms": 274620
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 275280,
   "end_ms": 278760,
   "text": " Hey, Uncle, what's Ikura's Kuram mean?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh.",
   "start_ms": 278880,
   "end_ms": 280080
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 282180,
   "start_ms": 280500,
   "text": " It's a memory erasing spell."
  },
  {
   "text": " So I can forget sad things.",
   "end_ms": 284520,
   "start_ms": 282300
  },
  {
   "text": " Sega was that important?",
   "start_ms": 285120,
   "end_ms": 287760
  },
  {
   "text": " There were a lot of sad times in Gran Bahamo.",
   "end_ms": 290940,
   "start_ms": 287820
  },
  {
   "text": " Wanna see?",
   "end_ms": 292140,
   "start_ms": 291060
  },
  {
   "text": " Uh, yeah.",
   "end_ms": 293580,
   "start_ms": 292200
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 305880,
   "text": " Oh, God, no.",
   "start_ms": 303720
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 308280,
   "text": " Make me forget.",
   "start_ms": 306060
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 309660,
   "text": " It's sad, right?",
   "start_ms": 308400
  },
  {
   "text": " Spirits of memory.",
   "start_ms": 310020,
   "end_ms": 312240
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 314160,
   "text": " Deliver unto a...",
   "start_ms": 312360
  },
  {
   "text": " I guess Sega... meant a lot to him.",
   "start_ms": 314220,
   "end_ms": 316200
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 320700,
   "text": " A week later?",
   "start_ms": 319260
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 321540,
   "end_ms": 323820,
   "text": " My uncle was discharged."
  },
  {
   "text": " So, he decided to find a way to make some money off his powers.",
   "start_ms": 323940,
   "end_ms": 327180
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 330600,
   "text": " We started by uploading videos to YouTube.",
   "start_ms": 327240
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 334260,
   "start_ms": 330660,
   "text": " But we only earned about 60,000 yen in that revenue."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 352320,
   "end_ms": 355860,
   "text": " Ribbon, can't you talk?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 0,
   "end_ms": 0,
   "text": ""
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 387420,
   "end_ms": 388680,
   "text": " I believe"
  },
  {
   "text": " overcome",
   "start_ms": 399000,
   "end_ms": 400680
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 444660,
   "text": " I've been meaning to ask you, why do you have such a big place?",
   "start_ms": 440400
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 446340,
   "text": " Uh...",
   "start_ms": 444720
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 448440,
   "text": " I was living with someone.",
   "start_ms": 447060
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 448560,
   "end_ms": 450780,
   "text": " But it got complicated."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 450900,
   "end_ms": 453120,
   "text": " Like with... a lover?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Not like that.",
   "start_ms": 453180,
   "end_ms": 454080
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 455400,
   "text": " Okay.",
   "start_ms": 454200
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 458100,
   "text": " Listen, they were just a roommate.",
   "start_ms": 455580
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 458700,
   "start_ms": 458160,
   "text": " Get it?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 459720,
   "text": " Huh?",
   "end_ms": 461160
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 461580,
   "end_ms": 464520,
   "text": " Roommates weren't a thing back then?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 465720,
   "text": " Whoa.",
   "start_ms": 464640
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 465840,
   "end_ms": 467520,
   "text": " You looked that up really fast."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 469680,
   "start_ms": 467640,
   "text": " What a tiny computer."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 471180,
   "end_ms": 472620,
   "text": " Huh?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 475740,
   "end_ms": 476460,
   "text": " So weird."
  },
  {
   "text": " You finding a friend to live with you here?",
   "start_ms": 476520,
   "end_ms": 479580
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 485640,
   "end_ms": 489060,
   "text": " Uncle. So tell me, what were people like in the other world?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 490080,
   "start_ms": 489120,
   "text": " What about your friends?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 492360,
   "start_ms": 490140,
   "text": " Um..."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 492480,
   "text": " I flew solo pretty much the entire time was there.",
   "end_ms": 495420
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 502380,
   "end_ms": 503880,
   "text": " I see."
  },
  {
   "text": " All the people in the other world were really hot.",
   "end_ms": 514860,
   "start_ms": 511500
  },
  {
   "text": " You trip over beautiful people.",
   "end_ms": 517140,
   "start_ms": 514919
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh, really?",
   "start_ms": 517260,
   "end_ms": 519059
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 519299,
   "end_ms": 521520,
   "text": " I must have been hideous."
  },
  {
   "text": " They hunted me down like I was an orc.",
   "end_ms": 534360,
   "start_ms": 530760
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 535620,
   "start_ms": 534480,
   "text": " Uncle."
  },
  {
   "text": " Hold on.",
   "start_ms": 536160,
   "end_ms": 536580
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 536700,
   "text": " And they would...",
   "end_ms": 538080
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 538920,
   "text": " Stop.",
   "start_ms": 538560
  },
  {
   "text": " I'm just trying to wash the dishes right now, man.",
   "start_ms": 539160,
   "end_ms": 542520
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 545340,
   "start_ms": 542580,
   "text": " Ah, it wasn't like that every day."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 547980,
   "start_ms": 545400,
   "text": " But there was one girl who was really aggressive."
  },
  {
   "text": " Tell me this later.",
   "end_ms": 549240,
   "start_ms": 548040
  },
  {
   "text": " She would show up every day... to harass me to my face.",
   "start_ms": 549360,
   "end_ms": 553020
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 557040,
   "text": " No matter what I did to prove myself, she would treat me like garbage.",
   "start_ms": 553080
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 560820,
   "text": " That's awful.",
   "start_ms": 558780
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 562920,
   "text": " Even in a fantasy world.",
   "start_ms": 560880
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 562980,
   "end_ms": 564240,
   "text": " That stuff happened."
  },
  {
   "text": " When we first met, I saved her from a monster, and she didn't even thank me.",
   "start_ms": 564480,
   "end_ms": 569340
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 571260,
   "text": " Oh, what was her problem?",
   "start_ms": 569400
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 571380,
   "end_ms": 572340,
   "text": " Right?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 575340,
   "text": " She was like, Nobody asked for your help.",
   "start_ms": 572400
  },
  {
   "text": " Don't touch me.",
   "end_ms": 576540,
   "start_ms": 575400
  },
  {
   "text": " Then I said, I didn't save you just a hit on you.",
   "start_ms": 576600,
   "end_ms": 579900
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 580800,
   "text": " How stuck up are you?",
   "start_ms": 579960
  },
  {
   "text": " Then she's all like, I'm the only one who can even stand to be around your or at face without puking before I drink.",
   "start_ms": 580920,
   "end_ms": 587040
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 590820,
   "text": " She was just really mean to me every day, all right?",
   "start_ms": 587280
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 593220,
   "text": " I ditched her in a city and then ran off.",
   "start_ms": 590880
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 600420,
   "start_ms": 599280,
   "text": " Don't touch me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 601020,
   "end_ms": 603180,
   "text": " I don't need your help."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 604140,
   "end_ms": 608280,
   "text": " I'm the only one who can stand your orc face without puking."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 608400,
   "text": " Four eyed and jerk.",
   "end_ms": 609960
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 616080,
   "text": " The Sundare Archetype wasn't established until 2004, four years after my uncle was in a coma.",
   "end_ms": 623100
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 625980,
   "text": " What happened to her?",
   "start_ms": 623160
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 626460,
   "text": " Huh?",
   "start_ms": 626040
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 626520,
   "text": " I don't know.",
   "end_ms": 627480
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 634560,
   "start_ms": 629040,
   "text": " If I'm being honest... Things weren't that great for me in the other world."
  },
  {
   "text": " But... coming back here? The Internet?",
   "start_ms": 636240,
   "end_ms": 640200
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 640380,
   "end_ms": 641460,
   "text": " Fiber lines?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 642180,
   "start_ms": 641580,
   "text": " Weepy?"
  },
  {
   "text": " It's all gray.",
   "end_ms": 643440,
   "start_ms": 642300
  },
  {
   "text": " And people around the world love my... videos?",
   "end_ms": 647580,
   "start_ms": 643560
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 647820,
   "end_ms": 649320,
   "text": " Huh?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 653820,
   "start_ms": 652440,
   "text": " Hmm?"
  },
  {
   "text": " It was then that my uncle fell into a new fantasy world, known as the Internet.",
   "start_ms": 654840,
   "end_ms": 660840
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 661680,
   "start_ms": 660960,
   "text": " Huh?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 664560,
   "start_ms": 661800,
   "text": " How does he know my face is red?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 664620,
   "end_ms": 665700,
   "text": " Am I on camera?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 665760,
   "end_ms": 667080,
   "text": " It's Internet slang."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 667140,
   "end_ms": 669660,
   "text": " And I never write in my own comments."
  },
  {
   "text": " Hey, don't worry.",
   "start_ms": 669780,
   "end_ms": 670980
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 671100,
   "end_ms": 672300,
   "text": " It's just a joke."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 674100,
   "text": " Hey.",
   "start_ms": 672660
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 676500,
   "text": " Why are they riding a bunch of W's?",
   "start_ms": 674280
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "start_ms": 676620,
   "end_ms": 677160
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 677280,
   "end_ms": 678660,
   "text": " He still needs to learn."
  },
  {
   "text": " About trolls?",
   "start_ms": 678780,
   "end_ms": 680100
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 685380,
   "start_ms": 683580,
   "text": " I want this phone."
  },
  {
   "text": " It doesn't flip.",
   "start_ms": 685440,
   "end_ms": 687540
  },
  {
   "text": " It spins.",
   "end_ms": 688200,
   "start_ms": 687600
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 690420,
   "text": " But it's... 2G.",
   "start_ms": 688380
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "start_ms": 690540,
   "end_ms": 691380
  },
  {
   "text": " So I buy it through this online auction, right?",
   "start_ms": 691440,
   "end_ms": 693660
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 697320,
   "start_ms": 693720,
   "text": " The problem is, it uses an old network, so I don't think you could even make calls."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 697440,
   "end_ms": 699900,
   "text": " But it spins."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 702840,
   "start_ms": 699960,
   "text": " Yeah, but how would you get in touch with your old friends?"
  },
  {
   "text": " Takafumi.",
   "end_ms": 705240,
   "start_ms": 703140
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 705360,
   "text": " Do you think a man who committed himself to Sega truly deserves to live a full life?",
   "end_ms": 711780
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 714840,
   "text": " Why is he letting a game system dictate his life so much?",
   "end_ms": 718500
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh.",
   "end_ms": 723300,
   "start_ms": 721680
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 725160,
   "text": " This one looks like the cheapest price.",
   "start_ms": 723420
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 726900,
   "text": " You already looked it up?",
   "start_ms": 725220
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 727200,
   "end_ms": 729840,
   "text": " Those little smartphones are really fast."
  },
  {
   "text": " You could always learn to use one.",
   "start_ms": 729900,
   "end_ms": 731820
  },
  {
   "text": " Touching, swiping, pinching.",
   "start_ms": 732720,
   "end_ms": 736560
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 739080,
   "text": " I prefer to have a bunch of buttons to push.",
   "start_ms": 736800
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 739140,
   "end_ms": 740100,
   "text": " I guess."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 740220,
   "end_ms": 746460,
   "text": " They don't make new versions of the cool phones that slide open or spin anymore, do they?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 747780,
   "start_ms": 746580,
   "text": " It's innovation."
  },
  {
   "text": " Everything is touchscreens.",
   "start_ms": 747900,
   "end_ms": 749760
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 749820,
   "end_ms": 752220,
   "text": " A lot happens in 17 years."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 752340,
   "text": " You know, I did some technical innovations of my own in the other world.",
   "end_ms": 756900
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 756960,
   "text": " Oh, yeah?",
   "end_ms": 757860
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 757920,
   "end_ms": 759600,
   "text": " Hmm..."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 763200,
   "start_ms": 759720,
   "text": " I met a pot that overflowed with water to stop a village's drought."
  },
  {
   "text": " Whoa, how?",
   "start_ms": 763260,
   "end_ms": 764640
  },
  {
   "text": " I used two spells...",
   "start_ms": 765120,
   "end_ms": 768420
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 768600,
   "end_ms": 770520,
   "text": " It'll just be easier to show you how I did it."
  },
  {
   "text": " Nigger is Elron.",
   "end_ms": 772620,
   "start_ms": 770640
  },
  {
   "text": " Whoa.",
   "end_ms": 777540,
   "start_ms": 775920
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 778740,
   "end_ms": 781380,
   "text": " Is this one of your memories?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 781440,
   "end_ms": 787680,
   "text": " There are these spell cards charged with magic... with a lot of work."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 787800,
   "end_ms": 791700,
   "text": " I managed to reverse the electrolysis process to create water."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 795060,
   "start_ms": 792420,
   "text": " You beat modern science?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 795120,
   "text": " Wow.",
   "end_ms": 795960
  },
  {
   "text": " You must have blown all their minds.",
   "end_ms": 797280,
   "start_ms": 796020
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 800280,
   "start_ms": 797340,
   "text": " I mean, I bet all those villagers were cheering your name."
  },
  {
   "text": " Nah.",
   "start_ms": 800460,
   "end_ms": 802200
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 805920,
   "end_ms": 807900,
   "text": " They tried to hang me."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 812760,
   "start_ms": 810960,
   "text": " They destroyed them."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 818760,
   "text": " I guess what I did was... sacrilegious.",
   "start_ms": 815820
  },
  {
   "text": " Stop!",
   "start_ms": 818880,
   "end_ms": 820380
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh, someone rescued you.",
   "end_ms": 823440,
   "start_ms": 820620
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 823560,
   "end_ms": 825840,
   "text": " Who was that awful woman?"
  },
  {
   "text": " What?",
   "start_ms": 825960,
   "end_ms": 826680
  },
  {
   "text": " That's her?",
   "start_ms": 826800,
   "end_ms": 827340
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 830220,
   "start_ms": 827400,
   "text": " Yes, I know he has an evil face."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 830280,
   "text": " It's like an orp!",
   "end_ms": 831780
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 833400,
   "start_ms": 831840,
   "text": " Another thing on one."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 834180,
   "text": " You wouldn't trust him.",
   "start_ms": 833460
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 834900,
   "start_ms": 834420,
   "text": " I promise."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 836520,
   "text": " What, Red, Graca?",
   "start_ms": 834960
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 841380,
   "start_ms": 839580,
   "text": " Good, great."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 843960,
   "start_ms": 841560,
   "text": " Yeah, that's pretty much it."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 850200,
   "text": " I get it.",
   "start_ms": 848580
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 853920,
   "text": " First person view is hard to follow.",
   "start_ms": 851340
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 853980,
   "end_ms": 855360,
   "text": " Hey, what's that?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 857280,
   "start_ms": 855480,
   "text": " Hmm..."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 860280,
   "text": " I can swipe here to rotate the camera.",
   "start_ms": 857460
  },
  {
   "text": " Yep, there we are.",
   "start_ms": 860340,
   "end_ms": 861240
  },
  {
   "text": " You can do that?",
   "start_ms": 861300,
   "end_ms": 862200
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 864060,
   "start_ms": 862260,
   "text": " Pinch in, to zoom out."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 865380,
   "text": " Whoa.",
   "start_ms": 864120
  },
  {
   "text": " You weren't kidding.",
   "start_ms": 865500,
   "end_ms": 866520
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 866580,
   "text": " You were being hunted.",
   "end_ms": 867360
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh, can we see, uh, what happened to that girl?",
   "start_ms": 867480,
   "end_ms": 870540
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 870660,
   "text": " Yeah.",
   "end_ms": 871260
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 871380,
   "text": " I'll pinch out to zoom in.",
   "end_ms": 873720
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 879720,
   "text": " My coward.",
   "start_ms": 878160
  },
  {
   "text": " He ran away?",
   "end_ms": 881760,
   "start_ms": 880020
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 888120,
   "start_ms": 886380,
   "text": " Loser."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 888420,
   "end_ms": 891420,
   "text": " She saved you, Ed, she's hot!"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 892560,
   "start_ms": 891480,
   "text": " Yeah, I know."
  },
  {
   "text": " I'm a coward.",
   "start_ms": 892680,
   "end_ms": 893820
  },
  {
   "text": " What?",
   "end_ms": 894780,
   "start_ms": 893940
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 897960,
   "text": " My auction?",
   "start_ms": 896160
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 904080,
   "end_ms": 905040,
   "text": " I'm!"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 905160,
   "end_ms": 905700,
   "text": " Wait?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 905760,
   "end_ms": 906660,
   "text": " How much is delivery?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 915900,
   "start_ms": 913860,
   "text": " My God."
  },
  {
   "text": " 2000!",
   "start_ms": 916020,
   "end_ms": 916860
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 916980,
   "end_ms": 919380,
   "text": " Their dress is on some remote island."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 924600,
   "start_ms": 920940,
   "text": " There's no fee if you meet them to get the phone in person."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 942720,
   "end_ms": 943080,
   "text": " Go!"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 948540,
   "text": " I'll be back.",
   "start_ms": 946500
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 957960,
   "start_ms": 955980,
   "text": " I'm home."
  },
  {
   "text": " Question.",
   "start_ms": 961920,
   "end_ms": 963540
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 966720,
   "end_ms": 968640,
   "text": " Could you pick up these headphones for me?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 970020,
   "start_ms": 968700,
   "text": " Where are they?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 970080,
   "end_ms": 971520,
   "text": " Kumamoto?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 972720,
   "start_ms": 971640,
   "text": " Five minutes."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 974520,
   "end_ms": 976500,
   "text": " And this sofa?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 976560,
   "end_ms": 978000,
   "text": " Uh, that looks really heavy."
  },
  {
   "text": " I will give you a shorter massage.",
   "end_ms": 979860,
   "start_ms": 978120
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 979920,
   "end_ms": 980820,
   "text": " Oh."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 981840,
   "text": " Oh, okay.",
   "start_ms": 981000
  },
  {
   "text": " That's how Uncle learned to bid online without paying shipping fees.",
   "start_ms": 981900,
   "end_ms": 986760
  },
  {
   "text": " Thanks.",
   "end_ms": 989820,
   "start_ms": 988380
  },
  {
   "text": " Hey, I would have gone to pick that up for you.",
   "start_ms": 991140,
   "end_ms": 994080
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 995280,
   "start_ms": 994200,
   "text": " It was free."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 995340,
   "end_ms": 996420,
   "text": " I have Amazon Prime."
  },
  {
   "text": " Is there a box cutter?",
   "end_ms": 997980,
   "start_ms": 996480
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 998040,
   "end_ms": 999600,
   "text": " Hmm..."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 999840,
   "end_ms": 1000800,
   "text": " Yeah."
  },
  {
   "text": " Thank you.",
   "start_ms": 1000920,
   "end_ms": 1001880
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1005000,
   "text": " Where did this come from?",
   "end_ms": 1006560
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1006620,
   "text": " A storage spell?",
   "end_ms": 1008180
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1008240,
   "text": " By the way, that thing can kill dragons, so be careful.",
   "end_ms": 1011660
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1011720,
   "end_ms": 1012920,
   "text": " That's so cool."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1013280,
   "text": " Did you bring anything else back with you?",
   "end_ms": 1016280
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1016580,
   "text": " A lot.",
   "end_ms": 1018260
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1018800,
   "end_ms": 1021320,
   "text": " Like a magic Zord."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1024859,
   "text": " Oh. Martuposet.",
   "start_ms": 1021620
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1024980,
   "end_ms": 1026359,
   "text": " I also have precious metals."
  },
  {
   "text": " What?",
   "end_ms": 1027200,
   "start_ms": 1026480
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1030800,
   "text": " The stone is a mermaid tear, crystallized by magic.",
   "start_ms": 1027319
  },
  {
   "text": " And the band was carved from rainbow coral.",
   "start_ms": 1030920,
   "end_ms": 1033800
  },
  {
   "text": " In the other world, you could buy a castle with this.",
   "start_ms": 1033920,
   "end_ms": 1036260
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1037339,
   "text": " Sell them!",
   "start_ms": 1036319
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1037400,
   "end_ms": 1038060,
   "text": " Sell them all!"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1039740,
   "start_ms": 1038119,
   "text": " 50 yen."
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "start_ms": 1039859,
   "end_ms": 1040880
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1041000,
   "end_ms": 1045200,
   "text": " I took them to a pawn shop, and they told me 50 yen."
  },
  {
   "text": " It's too rare.",
   "end_ms": 1046280,
   "start_ms": 1045260
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1048920,
   "text": " Hmm...",
   "start_ms": 1046640
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1050900,
   "text": " We're not getting as many views as I thought.",
   "start_ms": 1048980
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1052520,
   "start_ms": 1050960,
   "text": " I need a new idea."
  },
  {
   "text": " Uncle...?",
   "start_ms": 1052640,
   "end_ms": 1054260
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "end_ms": 1054620,
   "start_ms": 1054320
  },
  {
   "text": " So, I'm guessing you had this because... you were going to give it to someone?",
   "start_ms": 1054740,
   "end_ms": 1058880
  },
  {
   "text": " No.",
   "start_ms": 1059000,
   "end_ms": 1060140
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1061940,
   "text": " It's just a commemorative trophy.",
   "start_ms": 1060260
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1065780,
   "start_ms": 1062000,
   "text": " You have to beat a pretty hard dungeon to get one of them, though."
  },
  {
   "text": " I see.",
   "start_ms": 1065840,
   "end_ms": 1066920
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1076100,
   "end_ms": 1078380,
   "text": " You wanna talk about love?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1078500,
   "end_ms": 1079280,
   "text": " No."
  },
  {
   "text": " I doubt you ever had a romance in the other world.",
   "end_ms": 1081860,
   "start_ms": 1079400
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1083000,
   "start_ms": 1081980,
   "text": " No, thanks."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1083840,
   "text": " Yes, I did.",
   "start_ms": 1083060
  },
  {
   "text": " But I've been alive over 30 years.",
   "start_ms": 1083900,
   "end_ms": 1086000
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1086120,
   "end_ms": 1087440,
   "text": " I've gotten plenty of action."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1089180,
   "end_ms": 1092240,
   "text": " My first love was in elementary school."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1092300,
   "end_ms": 1093500,
   "text": " Who was she?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1093560,
   "end_ms": 1095360,
   "text": " Sonic and Tails."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1097040,
   "text": " What?",
   "start_ms": 1095660
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1106160,
   "text": " I'd go to the toy store every afternoon to watch the video demo play...",
   "end_ms": 1112160
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1113000,
   "text": " That title screen was so cute.",
   "end_ms": 1114500
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1114620,
   "end_ms": 1116540,
   "text": " I never got tired of it."
  },
  {
   "text": " Do you have people stories?",
   "start_ms": 1116720,
   "end_ms": 1118880
  },
  {
   "text": " Hm?",
   "start_ms": 1119000,
   "end_ms": 1119720
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1120320,
   "start_ms": 1119780,
   "text": " Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
   "text": " There was this girl... named Paidei Madasse.",
   "end_ms": 1124820,
   "start_ms": 1120620
  },
  {
   "text": " She was killed. I won't.",
   "start_ms": 1124940,
   "end_ms": 1127520
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1127580,
   "end_ms": 1130640,
   "text": " Then a brain was transferred into an evil cyborg body."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1130700,
   "text": " She attacked me after I hunted down the Seven Force.",
   "end_ms": 1133820
  },
  {
   "text": " She's the boss of Level Three, and takes on five?",
   "start_ms": 1133880,
   "end_ms": 1136880
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1137300,
   "end_ms": 1139280,
   "text": " This man had no life outside of games."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1139580,
   "text": " Were there any nice girls in the other world?",
   "end_ms": 1142640
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1142700,
   "text": " Oh.",
   "end_ms": 1143600
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1143780,
   "end_ms": 1144260,
   "text": " Sure."
  },
  {
   "text": " Really?",
   "end_ms": 1144740,
   "start_ms": 1144380
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1145400,
   "text": " Icarus?",
   "end_ms": 1147320
  },
  {
   "text": " El Ron.",
   "end_ms": 1148520,
   "start_ms": 1147440
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1170360,
   "text": " Thank you very much.",
   "start_ms": 1168380
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1200840,
   "text": " I managed to save her from that awful monster.",
   "end_ms": 1204320
  },
  {
   "text": " Looks more like she's sacrificing herself to protect her brothers.",
   "start_ms": 1204980,
   "end_ms": 1209000
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1210800,
   "text": " Pretty cool, right?",
   "start_ms": 1209120
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1214760,
   "text": " I think we got ambushed by goblins or something soon after this.",
   "start_ms": 1210860
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1214820,
   "text": " What?",
   "end_ms": 1215960
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1217160,
   "text": " I fell off a cliff.",
   "start_ms": 1216200
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1217340,
   "end_ms": 1218060,
   "text": " Never saw her again."
  },
  {
   "text": " That must have been terrible.",
   "start_ms": 1218120,
   "end_ms": 1219800
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1221180,
   "end_ms": 1222620,
   "text": " Huh?"
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1227000,
   "text": " Those, uh, those kids are looking a little suspicious back there.",
   "start_ms": 1222740
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1227060,
   "end_ms": 1229220,
   "text": " I should look at what attacked me."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1229280,
   "end_ms": 1231380,
   "text": " Oh, I'm sure he was a goblin."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1231980,
   "start_ms": 1231440,
   "text": " Yeah?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1232040,
   "text": " Oh, yeah, definitely.",
   "end_ms": 1233480
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh, whatever it was, huh?",
   "end_ms": 1236420,
   "start_ms": 1234140
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1236540,
   "end_ms": 1237260,
   "text": " Almost killed me."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1238940,
   "start_ms": 1237380,
   "text": " And that awful woman showed up."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1239000,
   "end_ms": 1239480,
   "text": " Really?"
  },
  {
   "text": " I hate to admit it, but she saved me.",
   "start_ms": 1239600,
   "end_ms": 1241700
  },
  {
   "text": " But why?",
   "start_ms": 1253760,
   "end_ms": 1255020
  },
  {
   "text": " Why, save me?",
   "start_ms": 1255680,
   "end_ms": 1257180
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1257300,
   "end_ms": 1258740,
   "text": " I did you a favor."
  },
  {
   "text": " You're in my debt.",
   "start_ms": 1258800,
   "end_ms": 1260360
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1260420,
   "text": " Now you'll spend the rest of your life trying to repay me.",
   "end_ms": 1263840
  },
  {
   "text": " Rest of my life.",
   "start_ms": 1265220,
   "end_ms": 1267260
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "end_ms": 1267860,
   "start_ms": 1267320
  },
  {
   "text": " I... I didn't mean it like that.",
   "end_ms": 1272960,
   "start_ms": 1270980
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1273020,
   "end_ms": 1275060,
   "text": " It's not like we're going to be together forever."
  },
  {
   "text": " Stop it!",
   "start_ms": 1278120,
   "end_ms": 1278960
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1279860,
   "text": " Stay right there!",
   "start_ms": 1279080
  },
  {
   "text": " I don't have much to pay you.",
   "start_ms": 1279920,
   "end_ms": 1282680
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1283520,
   "text": " What about this?",
   "start_ms": 1282800
  },
  {
   "text": " Huh?",
   "start_ms": 1283580,
   "end_ms": 1284720
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1289280,
   "text": " It's a cosmite ring.",
   "start_ms": 1287840
  },
  {
   "text": " One of only seven in the whole world.",
   "start_ms": 1289400,
   "end_ms": 1291200
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1292700,
   "text": " Hey, stop!",
   "start_ms": 1291260
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1292820,
   "text": " What are you doing?",
   "end_ms": 1293480
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1298340,
   "end_ms": 1300080,
   "text": " It should fit."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1302720,
   "text": " Uh... Uh, wait a second.",
   "start_ms": 1300140
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1305840,
   "text": " This is... too fast.",
   "start_ms": 1303140
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1306800,
   "start_ms": 1305900,
   "text": " You don't want it."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1307520,
   "text": " What?",
   "start_ms": 1306860
  },
  {
   "text": " I do.",
   "start_ms": 1313700,
   "end_ms": 1314780
  },
  {
   "text": " Did he just propose to her?",
   "end_ms": 1322940,
   "start_ms": 1321140
  },
  {
   "text": " Wait, is that allowed?",
   "end_ms": 1324980,
   "start_ms": 1323000
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1325100,
   "text": " From her reaction, it looks like they have the same marriage customs as us in the other world.",
   "end_ms": 1329540
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1329660,
   "end_ms": 1331280,
   "text": " At least it seems so."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1332720,
   "start_ms": 1331340,
   "text": " Of course I did."
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1338240,
   "text": " I even got the ring appraised for her in the next town.",
   "start_ms": 1334040
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1340880,
   "start_ms": 1338300,
   "text": " Oh, come on, Uncle!"
  },
  {
   "text": " Oh, no, is this the town you said you managed to lose her in?",
   "start_ms": 1345380,
   "end_ms": 1349940
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1352160,
   "start_ms": 1350000,
   "text": " No, she hung around after this."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1352220,
   "end_ms": 1354260,
   "text": " You know, I think she wanted my money."
  },
  {
   "text": " I put it all in the bank.",
   "start_ms": 1354320,
   "end_ms": 1356300
  },
  {
   "text": " Where are you going next, huh?",
   "end_ms": 1357920,
   "start_ms": 1356360
  },
  {
   "text": " What?",
   "end_ms": 1358580,
   "start_ms": 1357980
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1358700,
   "text": " You're resting here?",
   "end_ms": 1359480
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1359540,
   "text": " What a coincidence.",
   "end_ms": 1360440
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1361160,
   "start_ms": 1360500,
   "text": " So am I."
  },
  {
   "text": " She's persistent.",
   "start_ms": 1361220,
   "end_ms": 1362780
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1368840,
   "text": " Anyway, these rare items are all shockingly easy to use.",
   "start_ms": 1363560
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1372320,
   "text": " And you could put that dagger in here, too.",
   "start_ms": 1369320
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1372440,
   "end_ms": 1373280,
   "text": " Uh, sure."
  },
  {
   "text": " Whoa! Uncle's brand new video broke over two million views.",
   "start_ms": 1382400,
   "end_ms": 1389780
  },
  {
   "end_ms": 1409040,
   "start_ms": 1407840,
   "text": " Fall 2017."
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1410240,
   "end_ms": 1412400,
   "text": " My life with my uncle?"
  },
  {
   "start_ms": 1412700,
   "end_ms": 1415280,
   "text": " Just got a whole lot more interesting."
  }
 ],
